<title>MOROCCO: MOROCCO WPI FALLS 0.3 PERCENT IN JANUARY.</title>
<headline>MOROCCO WPI FALLS 0.3 PERCENT IN JANUARY.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's wholesale prices fell 0.3 percent in January after a 1.0 percent drop in December, producing a 1.7 percent year-on-year inflation, the Statistics Directorate said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The decline was mainly the result of a 0.5 percent drop in agricultural products and minus 0.2 percent in industrial produce.</p>
</text>
